He's the one who gets the machine.

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:07.040
So, did you make the rainbow or not?

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:10.230
As a matter of fact, I didn't.

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:11.550
What a shame.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:13.590
We all did it.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:17.170
I couldn't have done it without the help of my blue ribbon students.

00:22:18.340 --> 00:22:22.110
You mean, I can't have the pinball machine?

00:22:22.930 --> 00:22:23.370
Nope.

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:26.430
But you can come here and play it whenever you want.

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:27.360
Really?

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:28.740
