00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:29.970
Absolutely.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:30.660
Absolutely.

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:33.370
Oh, thank you, Miss Frizzle.

00:22:34.010 --> 00:22:36.560
I guess I owe you an apology, Carlos.

00:22:37.180 --> 00:22:38.920
Colors do come from light.

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:40.420
I knew that.

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.120
Well, I do now.

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:44.620
You know, that ruins your painting

