00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:54.790
Does that really work?

00:23:55.520 --> 00:23:56.600
Of course it works.

00:23:57.360 --> 00:23:59.960
Transparent things like candy wrappers and theater...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:04.900
gels act just like gates. They let their own color of light through and block off all

00:24:04.900 --> 00:24:11.760
the other colors. Wow, that's really cool. I'm going to try that myself. Bye. Hey, thanks

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:21.890
for calling. Magic School Bus, your iridescent leader here. Hi, light and color. You never

